---
heading: About Kaybee International
historyHeading: Five decades in Chennai
history: Kaybee International has traded from Thambu Chetty Street in Chennai for over fifty
  years, supplying bearing accessories to industrial manufacturers, OEMs and dealers across
  India. The business has grown on repeat custom rather than advertising, which tells you
  most of what matters about how it operates.
customHeading: Non-standard and custom requirements
custom: Beyond our standard catalogue we specialise in non-standard sizes of plummer blocks
  and sleeves, supporting customers whose equipment falls outside conventional dimensions.
  This covers replacement and retrofit applications, older machinery, and imported equipment
  where the original component is no longer obtainable. Send us the dimensions and we will
  tell you what can be made.
---

For over five decades, Kaybee International has been a trusted name in bearing accessories, serving industrial manufacturers, OEMs and dealers across India with products chosen for consistent quality and dependable performance.

From our base in Chennai we hold ready stocks and provide technically informed support, helping customers select the right housing, sleeve or locking component for their application, and delivering it on time.
